2. CORE INVESTMENT THESIS
============================================================

Modern agentic systems increasingly perform actions across multiple
execution boundaries.

The fundamental research problem is:

Can a governing invariant survive every mutation-capable boundary until
the irreversible mutation authority?

The commercial problem is:

How can organizations prove that an AI or automated system remained
authorized, policy-compliant, attributable, and governable throughout
execution?

The proposed technology portfolio addresses this problem through:

